      ],
      "heading": "It represents a groundbreaking platform for the telematics industry. The LX-45 is a 4G PROFESSIONAL device for advanced applications with high capacity backup battery. The Lx45 will maximize your fleet efficiency with features such as FMS CAN data (J1939), fuel CAN data (J1708), tachograph live data (K-Line), remote download of tachograph files and support for various third party RS232 or RS485 devices. The terminal is suitable for applications such as international logistics, refrigerated transport, agriculture, construction and mining, security and emergency services and even more. Highlights: Build highly customized telematics solutions Bluetooth LE 5.4 for wireless connectivity and sensor coverage Comprehensive power management Optional battery and IP-rated sealing Multiple wiring and installation options Remote control platform for script management and configuration Features:",
